+| 交互选择 profile | `bash /tmp/opencode-install --interactive` |
+| 系统目录安装 | `sudo env OPENCODE_INSTALL_DIR=/usr/local/bin bash /tmp/opencode-install --allow-sudo --no-modify-path` |
 
